{
  "openapi": "3.1.0",
  "info": {
    "title": "Doubao Seedance 2.5 视频生成 · 火山方舟 V3 原生端点",
    "version": "1.0.0",
    "description": "与火山方舟（Volcengine Ark）官方 V3 视频生成协议保持一致的端点。已经按官方文档写好的客户端，只需把 base URL 指向本网关、把 API Key 换成网关令牌即可，请求体与响应体无需改动。\n\n如果你是新接入、且可能同时用到其它厂商的视频模型，建议改用通用端点（seedance-2-5-unified.json）——同一套请求体换个 `model` 就能切模型。\n\n## 与官方的差异\n\n| 项 | 说明 |\n| --- | --- |\n| 任务 `id` | 返回的是**网关任务 ID**，不是上游 ID。查询也必须用它。 |\n| `callback_url` | **不透传**。网关自行轮询上游，请改用轮询查询接口。 |\n| 查询响应 `content.video_url` | 返回网关侧的结果地址，不暴露上游直链。 |\n| 不支持的参数 | `seed` / `camera_fixed` / `frames` / `draft` / `service_tier=flex` 是 Seedance 1.x 的能力，2.5 不支持。网关会**直接报错**而不是静默丢弃，避免你以为参数生效了却拿到不符预期的结果。 |\n\n## 三种互斥场景\n\n**图生视频-首帧**、**图生视频-首尾帧**、**多模态参考生视频**（参考图 / 参考视频 / 参考音频）三者不可混用，网关会在提交前拒绝混合请求。\n\n> 单独传入 1 张**不带 `role`** 的图片等同于 `first_frame`（官方的图生视频-首帧写法）；传多张或与其它素材混用时，无 `role` 的图片按参考图处理。\n\n需要「首尾帧 + 多模态参考」的效果时，用多模态参考并在提示词里指定某张图作为首帧 / 尾帧。\n\n## 调用流程\n\n1. `POST /api/v3/contents/generations/tasks` 提交任务，拿到 `id`\n2. 轮询 `GET /api/v3/contents/generations/tasks/{task_id}` 直到 `status` 为 `succeeded` / `failed` / `expired`\n3. 成功后从 `content.video_url` 取视频地址\n\n建议轮询间隔 5~10 秒。\n\n\n## 素材要求\n\n**图片**（首帧 / 尾帧 / 参考图）\n\n| 项 | 要求 |\n| --- | --- |\n| 格式 | jpeg / png / webp / bmp / tiff / gif / heic / heif |\n| 宽高比 | 0.4 ~ 2.5 |\n| 宽高长度 | 300 ~ 6000 px |\n| 大小 | 单张 < 30 MB |\n| 数量 | 首帧 1 张、首尾帧 2 张、参考图 1~30 张 |\n\n**参考视频**\n\n| 项 | 要求 |\n| --- | --- |\n| 格式 | mp4 / mov（视频 H.264、H.265；音频 AAC、MP3） |\n| 分辨率 | 480p / 720p / 1080p / 4k |\n| 时长 | 单个 2~30 秒，最多 10 个，合计 ≤ 30 秒 |\n| 尺寸 | 宽高比 0.4~2.5；宽高 300~6000 px；总像素 409,600 ~ 8,295,044 |\n| 帧率 | 24 ~ 60 FPS |\n| 大小 | 单个 ≤ 200 MB |\n\n**参考音频**\n\n| 项 | 要求 |\n| --- | --- |\n| 格式 | wav / mp3 |\n| 时长 | 单段 2~30 秒，最多 10 段，合计 ≤ 30 秒 |\n| 大小 | 单个 ≤ 15 MB |\n\n整个请求体不超过 64 MB。\n\n> **含真人人脸的素材**：上游不接受直接上传含真人人脸的参考图 / 参考视频。可改用该账号近 30 天内由 Seedance 2.5 / 2.0 生成的含人脸产物、预置虚拟人像，或已授权的真人素材。\n\n## 提示词内传参（`--` 弱校验）\n\n上游支持在提示词末尾追加 `--rs 720p --rt 16:9 --dur 5 --wm true` 这类参数，网关原样透传、不做解析。两点注意：\n\n- 它是**弱校验**，写错了会被上游忽略而不是报错；请求体里的同名参数是强校验，推荐用请求体\n- 网关的**预扣**只看请求体，所以用 `--dur` 改时长会让预扣与实际不符。**最终扣费不受影响** —— 结算按上游返回的真实用量重算，多退少补\n\n## 计费\n\n按「输出分辨率 × 计费秒数」计费，**计费秒数 = 输出时长 + 参考视频时长**。输入参考图与参考音频不单独收费。\n\n输入含参考视频时，整单换一档更低的单价（这是上游的规则，不是本站优惠）：\n\n| 分辨率 | 输入不含视频 | 输入含参考视频 |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 720p | $0.22541/秒 | $0.13542/秒 |\n| 480p | $0.10416/秒 | $0.06258/秒 |\n\n单价按每档分辨率里像素最多的宽高比定，保证任何比例都不会成本倒挂。实际扣费 = 上表算出的金额 × 你所在分组的倍率。具体单价以模型广场展示为准。\n\n**预扣与结算**：`duration` 为 `-1`（默认值，模型自选时长）时提交阶段无法预知时长，按 15 秒预扣；带参考视频时其真实时长同样只有 URL 无从得知，按官方上限 30 秒预扣。任务完成后网关按上游返回的真实用量重算，多退少补。"
  },
  "servers": [
    {
      "url": "https://your-gateway.example.com",
      "description": "将 URL 替换为你的网关地址"
    }
  ],
  "security": [
    {
      "BearerAuth": []
    }
  ],
  "tags": [
    {
      "name": "视频生成",
      "description": "火山方舟 V3 原生协议"
    }
  ],
  "paths": {
    "/api/v3/contents/generations/tasks": {
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "视频生成"
        ],
        "summary": "提交视频生成任务",
        "description": "所有输入都放在 `content` 数组里，通过 `type` 与 `role` 区分用途。\n\nSeedance 2.5 的提示词是**可选**的：纯首尾帧、甚至只传一段参考音频都是合法组合，但四类内容不能全空。",
        "operationId": "createSeedance25Task",
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/CreateTaskRequest"
              },
              "examples": {
                "text-to-video": {
                  "summary": "文生视频",
                  "value": {
                    "model": "doubao-seedance-2-5",
                    "content": [
                      {
                        "type": "text",
                        "text": "小猫对着镜头打哈欠，阳光洒在窗台上"
                      }
                    ],
                    "resolution": "720p",
                    "ratio": "16:9",
                    "duration": 5
                  }
                },
                "image-to-video": {
                  "summary": "图生视频（首帧）",
                  "value": {
                    "model": "doubao-seedance-2-5",
                    "content": [
                      {
                        "type": "text",
                        "text": "镜头缓慢推近，人物回头微笑"
                      },
                      {
                        "type": "image_url",
                        "image_url": {
                          "url": "https://example.com/first.jpg"
                        },
                        "role": "first_frame"
                      }
                    ],
                    "resolution": "720p"
                  }
                },
                "first-last-frame": {
                  "summary": "首尾帧生视频",
                  "value": {
                    "model": "doubao-seedance-2-5",
                    "content": [
                      {
                        "type": "image_url",
                        "image_url": {
                          "url": "https://example.com/first.jpg"
                        },
                        "role": "first_frame"
                      },
                      {
                        "type": "image_url",
                        "image_url": {
                          "url": "https://example.com/last.jpg"
                        },
                        "role": "last_frame"
                      }
                    ],
                    "resolution": "720p"
                  }
                },
                "multimodal-reference": {
                  "summary": "多模态参考生视频",
                  "value": {
                    "model": "doubao-seedance-2-5",
                    "content": [
                      {
                        "type": "text",
                        "text": "让画面里的人物按参考视频的节奏起舞"
                      },
                      {
                        "type": "image_url",
                        "image_url": {
                          "url": "https://example.com/ref.jpg"
                        },
                        "role": "reference_image"
                      },
                      {
                        "type": "video_url",
                        "video_url": {
                          "url": "https://example.com/ref.mp4"
                        },
                        "role": "reference_video"
                      },
                      {
                        "type": "audio_url",
                        "audio_url": {
                          "url": "https://example.com/bgm.wav"
                        },
                        "role": "reference_audio"
                      }
                    ],
                    "resolution": "720p",
                    "duration": -1
                  }
                },
                "audio-only": {
                  "summary": "仅音频（2.5 独有，无需提示词）",
                  "value": {
                    "model": "doubao-seedance-2-5",
                    "content": [
                      {
                        "type": "audio_url",
                        "audio_url": {
                          "url": "https://example.com/voice.mp3"
                        },
                        "role": "reference_audio"
                      }
                    ],
                    "resolution": "720p"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "任务已提交",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/CreateTaskResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "400": {
            "description": "参数不合法（含 2.5 不支持的参数、互斥场景混用、算不出价格等）",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/TaskError"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api/v3/contents/generations/tasks/{task_id}": {
      "get": {
        "tags": [
          "视频生成"
        ],
        "summary": "查询视频生成任务",
        "operationId": "getSeedance25Task",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "task_id",
            "in": "path",
            "required": true,
            "description": "提交接口返回的网关任务 ID",
            "schema": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "任务详情",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/TaskDetail"
                },
                "examples": {
                  "succeeded": {
                    "summary": "生成成功",
                    "value": {
                      "id": "task_xxxxxxxx",
                      "model": "doubao-seedance-2-5",
                      "status": "succeeded",
                      "content": {
                        "video_url": "https://your-gateway.example.com/v1/videos/task_xxxxxxxx/content"
                      },
                      "resolution": "720p",
                      "ratio": "16:9",
                      "duration": 5,
                      "framespersecond": 24,
                      "usage": {
                        "completion_tokens": 108000,
                        "total_tokens": 108000
                      },
                      "created_at": 1767225600,
                      "updated_at": 1767225720
                    }
                  },
                  "running": {
                    "summary": "生成中",
                    "value": {
                      "id": "task_xxxxxxxx",
                      "model": "doubao-seedance-2-5",
                      "status": "running",
                      "created_at": 1767225600
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "components": {
    "securitySchemes": {
      "BearerAuth": {
        "type": "http",
        "scheme": "bearer",
        "description": "在 `Authorization: Bearer <你的 API Key>` 头中传入令牌。"
      }
    },
    "schemas": {
      "CreateTaskRequest": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "model",
          "content"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "model": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "模型名。`doubao-seedance-2-5` 与火山官方 endpoint 名 `doubao-seedance-2-5-260628` 等价。",
            "examples": [
              "doubao-seedance-2-5"
            ]
          },
          "content": {
            "type": "array",
            "minItems": 1,
            "description": "输入内容列表。四类内容（文本 / 图片 / 视频 / 音频）不能全空。",
            "items": {
              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ContentItem"
            }
          },
          "resolution": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "480p",
              "720p"
            ],
            "default": "720p",
            "description": "2.5 不支持 1080p 与 4k，传了会报错而不是静默降级。"
          },
          "ratio": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "adaptive",
              "21:9",
              "16:9",
              "4:3",
              "1:1",
              "3:4",
              "9:16"
            ],
            "default": "adaptive",
            "description": "输出视频宽高比。`adaptive` 表示由模型按任务类型和输入内容自动适配。\n\n- **首帧 / 首尾帧**：官方默认且仅支持 `adaptive`（输出跟随首帧图片），指定具体比例会被网关拒绝\n- **视频编辑 / 视频延长**：同样只支持 `adaptive`（输出跟随待编辑视频）\n- **文生视频 / 参考生视频**：可指定，也可用 `adaptive` 让模型自选"
          },
          "duration": {
            "type": "integer",
            "default": -1,
            "description": "视频时长（秒）。`-1` 表示由模型在 4~30 秒内自选；其余取值范围 4~30。视频编辑任务只接受 `-1`。\n\n注意：`-1` 时提交阶段按 15 秒预扣，完成后按真实用量退还差额。",
            "examples": [
              -1,
              5,
              10
            ]
          },
          "generate_audio": {
            "type": "boolean",
            "default": true,
            "description": "是否生成与画面同步的音频。"
          },
          "output_format": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "mp4",
              "mov"
            ],
            "default": "mp4",
            "description": "`mov` 为高色彩精度的专业格式，部分播放器不兼容。"
          },
          "watermark": {
            "type": "boolean",
            "default": false,
            "description": "是否在右下角添加「AI 生成」水印。"
          },
          "return_last_frame": {
            "type": "boolean",
            "default": false,
            "description": "是否额外生成尾帧图像。注意：网关当前不对外返回尾帧地址（上游直链不做透传）。"
          },
          "priority": {
            "type": "integer",
            "minimum": 0,
            "maximum": 9,
            "default": 0,
            "description": "队列优先级，数值越大越靠前。"
          },
          "execution_expires_after": {
            "type": "integer",
            "minimum": 3600,
            "maximum": 259200,
            "default": 172800,
            "description": "任务超时阈值（秒）。超时后任务变为 `expired`。"
          },
          "safety_identifier": {
            "type": "string",
            "maxLength": 64,
            "description": "终端用户的唯一标识，建议传哈希值，不要传明文用户信息。"
          },
          "tools": {
            "type": "array",
            "description": "工具配置。目前仅支持联网搜索。",
            "items": {
              "type": "object",
              "required": [
                "type"
              ],
              "properties": {
                "type": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "enum": [
                    "web_search"
                  ]
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "ContentItem": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "type"
        ],
        "description": "一个输入条目。`role` 决定它的用途，也决定这次请求属于哪种场景。",
        "properties": {
          "type": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "text",
              "image_url",
              "video_url",
              "audio_url"
            ]
          },
          "text": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "提示词。可选，多条会按顺序拼接。"
          },
          "image_url": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/URLRef"
          },
          "video_url": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/URLRef"
          },
          "audio_url": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/URLRef"
          },
          "role": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "first_frame",
              "last_frame",
              "reference_image",
              "reference_video",
              "reference_audio"
            ],
            "description": "图片可为 `first_frame` / `last_frame` / `reference_image`（最多 30 张）；视频固定 `reference_video`（最多 10 个，单个 2~30 秒、合计 ≤30 秒）；音频固定 `reference_audio`（最多 10 段，同上限）。\n\n**首帧**、**首尾帧**、**多模态参考** 是三种互斥场景，不能混用。只传 1 张图且不带 `role` 时等同于 `first_frame`。传 `last_frame` 必须同时传 `first_frame`；两张图可以相同，宽高比不一致时以首帧为准、尾帧自动居中裁剪。"
          }
        }
      },
      "URLRef": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "url"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "url": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "支持三种写法：\n- **公网 URL**\n- **Base64**：`data:image/<格式>;base64,<编码>`（格式需小写）。大文件请勿使用，请求体上限 64 MB\n- **素材 ID**：`asset://<ASSET_ID>`，取自火山的素材 & 虚拟人像库"
          }
        }
      },
      "CreateTaskResponse": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "id": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "网关任务 ID，查询时使用。",
            "examples": [
              "task_xxxxxxxx"
            ]
          },
          "task_id": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "与 `id` 相同，便于兼容按 `task_id` 取值的客户端。"
          },
          "status": {
            "type": "string",
            "examples": [
              "queued"
            ]
          },
          "model": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "created_at": {
            "type": "integer"
          }
        }
      },
      "TaskDetail": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "id": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "网关任务 ID"
          },
          "model": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "status": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "queued",
              "running",
              "succeeded",
              "failed"
            ],
            "description": "上游的 `expired`（任务超时）会归一为 `failed`，失败原因在 `error.message` 里。"
          },
          "content": {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "video_url": {
                "type": "string",
                "description": "网关侧的结果地址，不是上游直链。"
              }
            }
          },
          "resolution": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "ratio": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "duration": {
            "type": "integer",
            "description": "实际输出时长（秒），为 `总帧数 / 24` 向下取整。"
          },
          "framespersecond": {
            "type": "integer"
          },
          "usage": {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "completion_tokens": {
                "type": "integer",
                "description": "上游的计费口径，已包含参考视频折算的 token 与最低用量下限。"
              },
              "total_tokens": {
                "type": "integer"
              },
              "tool_usage": {
                "type": "object",
                "properties": {
                  "web_search": {
                    "type": "integer",
                    "description": "联网搜索的实际调用次数，0 表示模型判断后没有搜索。"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "error": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/TaskErrorDetail"
          },
          "created_at": {
            "type": "integer"
          },
          "updated_at": {
            "type": "integer"
          }
        }
      },
      "TaskErrorDetail": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "code": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "message": {
            "type": "string"
          }
        }
      },
      "TaskError": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "error": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/TaskErrorDetail"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
